  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's motion and perception interface, exposing all controllable actions and uncontrollable sensor events. The main specification E1 encodes the safe, coverage-oriented supervisor: it prioritizes random_walk in clear states, uses move_forward only in a short commit state, and enforces conservative, deterministic recovery using directed turns or full_rotate after obstacles. Recovery states are one-shot and only allow a single turn action. The supervisor always returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear, avoids oscillations, and never enables forward or random_walk in obstacle states.",
